        return [(r + dr, c + dc) for dr, dc in [(-1,0), (1,0), (0,-1), (0,1)] if is_free(grid, (r + dr, c + dc))]

    def search(frontier, forward, came_from, g, other_g, other_start):
        if not frontier:
            return None
        _, cost, pos = heapq.heappop(frontier)
        if pos in other_g:
            path = []
            path1 = fill_path(came_from, pos)
            path2 = fill_path(other_g, pos, reverse=True)
            path = path1 + path2[1:]
            return path
        if pos in g and g[pos] < cost:
            return None
        g[pos] = cost
        for next_pos in neighbors(pos):
            new_cost = cost + 1
            if next_pos not in g or g[next_pos] > new_cost:
                new_f = new_cost + manhattan(next_pos, other_start)
                heapq.heappush(frontier, (new_f, new_cost, next_pos))
                if next_pos not in came_from or g[next_pos] > new_cost:
                    came_from[next_pos] = pos
        return None

    def fill_path(came_from, end, reverse=False):
        path = [end]
        while path[-1] in came_from:
            path.append(came_from[path[-1]])
        if reverse:
            path.reverse()
        return path

    forward_frontier = [(manhattan(start, goal), 0, start)]
    backward_frontier = [(manhattan(goal, start), 0, goal)]
    forward_g = {}
    backward_g = {}
    forward_came_from = {}
    backward_came_from = {}
    forward_g[start] = 0
    backward_g[goal] = 0

    while forward_frontier and backward_frontier:
        path = search(forward_frontier, True, forward_came_from, forward_g, backward_g, goal)
        if path and path[0] == start and path[-1] == goal:
            return path
        path = search(backward_frontier, False, backward_came_from, backward_g, forward_g, start)
        if path and path[0] == start and path[-1] == goal:
            return path
    return []
